{"4008840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Erehwon(エレフォーン)", "steam_appid": 4008840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Piece of Gear Changes How You Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erehwon is a loot-driven dungeon crawler where each new find can redefine your party’s roles and formation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Builds in Constant Flux</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need to memorize a “correct” character build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies in adapting your tactics on the fly with the gear you have at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover how to utilize the equipment you've acquired, you'll uncover new ways to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment changes can completely shift the tide of battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you acquire powerful gear,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll find you can handle enemies that were previously giving you trouble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party management unbound by class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While each class has its own characteristics, roles aren't fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap positions and duties based on equipment, reshaping your entire party into a single build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture into the dungeon with your unique adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set any image you like as your character's portrait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the labyrinth with your very own adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Video Posting and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming gameplay videos of this game is permitted for both individuals and corporations. No individual notification is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through video streaming is also permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from any usage that significantly damages the game's image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the store page in the description field or similar areas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed streaming guidelines can be found on the Knight of Karate X account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that these guidelines may be added to or changed without prior notice.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Piece of Gear Changes How You Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erehwon is a loot-driven dungeon crawler where each new find can redefine your party’s roles and formation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Builds in Constant Flux</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need to memorize a “correct” character build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies in adapting your tactics on the fly with the gear you have at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you discover how to utilize the equipment you've acquired, you'll uncover new ways to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment changes can completely shift the tide of battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you acquire powerful gear,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll find you can handle enemies that were previously giving you trouble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party management unbound by class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While each class has its own characteristics, roles aren't fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap positions and duties based on equipment, reshaping your entire party into a single build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture into the dungeon with your unique adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set any image you like as your character's portrait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the labyrinth with your very own adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Video Posting and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming gameplay videos of this game is permitted for both individuals and corporations. No individual notification is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through video streaming is also permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from any usage that significantly damages the game's image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the store page in the description field or similar areas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed streaming guidelines can be found on the Knight of Karate X account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that these guidelines may be added to or changed without prior notice.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The gear you acquire completely transforms your party’s roles. Erehwon is a loot-driven dungeon crawler where you progress by reshaping your builds around the gear you find.", "supported_languages": "Japanese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008840/89526be867571ecfa363ae6ee08ddb007fda6295/header.jpg?t=1786683546", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008840/f903d29bb1bdb7db8fe39caf818e416dc1434783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786683546", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008840/f903d29bb1bdb7db8fe39caf818e416dc1434783/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786683546", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 8.1/10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340相当以上(2013年 第四世代)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGLに対応したもの VRAM 1 GB以上<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Knight of Karate"], "publishers": ["Knight of Karate"], "demos": [{"appid": 4363050, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platfor